{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":70603,"ns":0,"title":"Hermeneutics","extract":"Hermeneutics () is the study of the methodological principles of interpretation, especially the interpretation of biblical texts, wisdom literature, and philosophical texts. As necessary, hermeneutics may include the art of understanding and communication.","description":"The study of the methodological principles of interpretation","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}